# Repo-root build-context whitelist for Darkula images (PR 7).
#
# Everything except the explicitly listed paths is excluded from any
# podman build whose context is the repository root, so the crawler-runtime
# and fake-world images never carry the full repository (no app code, no
# secrets, no credentials, no writable mounts).
*
!crawler-runtime/
!src/darkula/__init__.py
!src/darkula/testing/__init__.py
!src/darkula/testing/fake_world/
!src/darkula/crawler/runtime_protocol.py
